GST/Total supplies (1A/G1)

	

To compare GST collected with total supplies made for the quarter.

	

Variation in this ratio will indicate a variation in the extent or proportion of GST-Free and input taxed supplies. A graph of this ratio will indicate at a glance whether an entity makes only taxable supplies.

	

