.

Where checks indicate there are overdue debts and lodgments (i.e. returns and/or statements) you must consider and understand any action being taken by Frontline Compliance (FC) and/or IAL Lodgment and contact the actioning case officer.

After initial contact with the taxpayer, it may also be necessary to obtain additional information which further expands your understanding of the taxpayer (e.g. Company and Industry Research
