Payment Dashboard provides access to gadgets that provide payment related information.

Account Balance (Debt)
	

Summary of the taxpayers ICP account balances for those accounts in a Debt situation now (or have been in the past).

Data Driven Insights for Payment Plans (available in the drill down link) is one indicator of whether a payment plan may be acceptable.  


Debt Snapshot
	

Graphical summary of the debt breakdown and trend.


