What is reportable?
• Threshold Transaction Report - Financial and Bullion Services (TTR-FBS)
• Threshold Transaction Report - Investment, Superannuation and Insurance (TTR-ISI)
• Threshold Transaction Report - Money Services Businesses (TTR-MSB)
- $10,000 or more cash
• Solicitor Significant Cash Transactions (SOLTR)
- $10,000 or more cash
- Solicitors
• Threshold Transaction Report - Gambling Services (TTR-GS)
- $10,000 or more cash
- TABs, Totes, Bookmakers & Casinos
• Cross Border Movements – Physical Currency (CBM-MI)
- Carrying and sending $10,000 (AUD Equivalent) across international border of physical currency and/or bearer 
negotiable instruments
• International Funds Transfer Instruction - Electronic (IFTI-Electronic)
• International Funds Transfer Instruction - Designated Remittance Arrangement (IFTI-DRA)
• IFTI Transfer Report (TRNFR-SW)
