The event history in IPS confirms that an automated notice resulting from any action you have taken (for example, ATO revision) has issued. The event detail recorded in the event history will be 'LADV ASSESSMENT NOTICE' with a date and a timestamp. This event occurs automatically when the AS reaches FIN status. Where a revised AS remains held in RCVD status, the LADV event will not be visible in the event history in IPS until the AS is finalised.

